  "description": {
    "text": "The 2010 tournament took Ho-Oh and Lugia as its theme, for HeartGold and SoulSilver. Every player of its prefectural tournaments, held in all 47 prefectures from January 2010, got Lugia 047/L-P and Ho-Oh 048/L-P, card game players a double-sided playmat as well; players of the two Last Challenge qualifiers of May and June got neither. The final was held on 20 June 2010 at Tokyo Dome City Prism Hall, where the top finishers got Master's Key 068/L-P in an acrylic plaque, red for the card game and blue for the video game, and invitations to the World Championships in Hawaii that August.",
